sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant UI as Web UI
    participant API as API
    participant PS as Product Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant PG as Payment Gateway

    U->>UI: Add product to cart
    UI->>API: POST /cart/add
    API->>PS: addProductToCart()
    PS->>DB: update cart, check inventory
    DB-->>PS: cart updated
    PS-->>API: cart response
    API-->>UI: cart updated
    U->>UI: Checkout
    UI->>API: POST /cart/checkout
    API->>PS: checkoutCart()
    PS->>DB: create order, update inventory
    PS->>PG: process payment
    PG-->>PS: payment confirmation
    PS->>DB: update order, payment status
    PS-->>API: order confirmation
    API-->>UI: show order confirmation
